<!--
  OpenTK 3.3.3 - Android build (net8.0-android).
  Sources are vendored from https://github.com/opentk/opentk tag 3.3.3 (see
  PROVENANCE.md); the file list and defines mirror the original
  src/OpenTK/OpenTK.Android.csproj (Xamarin.Android), modernized to the .NET
  Android SDK.

  Contains AndroidGameView, the EGL platform layer and the OpenGL ES 1.0/1.1/
  2.0/3.0/3.1 bindings (OpenTK.Graphics.ES10/ES11/ES20/ES30/ES31).

  Requires: dotnet workload install android
-->
